# One gust front crossing grass, then a bush, then a tree crown
# (src/render/wind.gdshaderinc gust_at; grass.gdshader and world.gdshader's
# sward sheen; leaf.gdshader, where a gust turns the leaves pale side up).
#   tools/tour.sh tours/foliage_front.tour --seed=7
# `near front` (18_trample) stands the player in grass upwind of a bush that has
# a crown downwind of it on the world's wind line, so from above the frame runs
# grass, bush, crown along the way the front travels, and a strong held wind
# carries a front about 5.6 tiles a second. 01-04 are 0.4 s apart from above;
# 05-06 over the shoulder, 0.4 s apart.
weather clear:0:wind=1
hour 11
coast calm
place coast
near front
zoom 9
wait 2.0
shot 01-front-from-above with land:coast,prop:bush
wait 0.4
shot 02-front-0.4s-on with land:coast,prop:bush
wait 0.4
shot 03-front-0.8s-on with land:coast,prop:bush
wait 0.4
shot 04-front-1.2s-on with land:coast,prop:bush
zoom 12
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
wait 1.0
shot 05-front-over-the-shoulder with land:coast
wait 0.4
shot 06-front-over-the-shoulder-0.4s-on with land:coast
release shoulder_peek
weather rules
